/-!
# `+past-if` of `+comp` (README Gaps 25)

`+past-if` is door arm `882366` (188 cells): a gate on `[nex nom region]`
whose battery `piBat` is `[6 [6 piLok piSnd [1 1]] [[0 12] [0 30]] piRest]`
(nouns by `tools/gen/runhintk.py`): `piLok` the test
`?=(?(~ [%1 ~ ~]) lok.sure.laz.nex)`, `piSnd` the slam of `+sound` (door
arm `13654`) on `[nom (need-to-ordered ned.sure.laz.nex)]`
(`+need-to-ordered` is arm `44732` of `K`, `nta_gate`), `piRest` the
`%hop` block, `+set-tag` and the bond `[o [sure ~ ~]]` under `*sure`.

* `SoundAt ctx snd nom`: `+sound` on `nom` returns the model's `snd`, for
  every need; `soundAt_of`: so it does when `snd` is `+sound-far` of the
  code table at depth `3` (`sf_gate` through `snd_gate`).
* **`comp_past_if`**: `+past-if` is `pastIfL snd` on every `next`, every
  nomm with `SoundAt`, every region.
-/

